=============================================================================
Ring Fountain CFD Debug Log
Date: 2026-03-07
=============================================================================

ISSUE 1: blockMesh Topology Error
----------------------------------
Error: "face 0 in patch 2 vertices 4(...) does not have neighbour cell face"
Cause: blockMeshDict 中边界面定义跨越多个 block，或缺少内部面定义
Fix: 重写 blockMeshDict，将每个侧面分成水区和气区两部分

ISSUE 2: MPI Root Permission
-----------------------------
Error: "mpirun has detected an attempt to run as root. Running as root is 
        *strongly* discouraged"
Cause: WSL 中以 root 用户运行 OpenFOAM
Fix: 在 Allrun 中添加 --allow-run-as-root 选项
     修改: mpirun -np $NP ... → mpirun --allow-run-as-root -np $NP ...

ISSUE 3: Missing pointDisplacement File
----------------------------------------
Error: "cannot find file .../processor3/0/pointDisplacement"
Cause: sixDoFRigidBodyMotion 求解器需要初始位移场文件
Fix: 创建 0/pointDisplacement 文件，包含零位移边界条件

ISSUE 4: sixDoFRigidBodyMotionCoeffs Missing Solver
---------------------------------------------------
Error: "Entry 'solver' not found in dictionary stream/sixDoFRigidBodyMotionCoeffs"
Cause: dynamicMeshDict 中 sixDoFRigidBodyMotionCoeffs 缺少 solver 条目
Fix: 移除 solver 条目（OpenFOAM 2412 默认使用 Newmark）

ISSUE 5: snappyHexMesh Features Format Error
--------------------------------------------
Error: "for geometry ring.stl detected 0 uncached triangles out of 480"
Cause: snappyHexMeshDict 中 features 尝试直接读取 STL 作为边网格
Fix: 注释掉 features 部分，使用直接表面 refinement

